    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comical Sara is a roguelite FPS where you can shoot enemies without reloading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the energetic engineer Sara and blast away evil aliens in a thrilling, over-the-top firefight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.poster.avif?t=1752236363\" width=556 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.webm?t=1752236363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.mp4?t=1752236363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No reloads, no ammo pickups. Just shoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about reloading - your ammo is infinite! Enjoy pure, uninterrupted action as you mow down hordes of enemies with non-stop gunfire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-wield for double the firepower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sara can equip a different gun in each hand. Choose your favorite combos and unleash overwhelming firepower to dominate the battlefield in your own style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly generated levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: level layouts, enemy spawns, and item drops are all randomized. Sometimes you'll get lucky. Sometimes you'll be cornered. How you survive is up to your skills and decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get stronger, run after run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Sara falls, your progress resets - but the money you've earned can be used to unlock permanent upgrades. With every run, you'll get a little stronger. Take on the challenge, experiment, and enjoy the sweet feeling of progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you beat Hell Mode?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five difficulty levels. Start off with the light-hearted Comical Mode - even a baby could clear it (probably). But the ultimate challenge awaits in Hell Mode, where only the toughest players survive. Are you ready to push your limits?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comical Sara is a roguelite FPS where you can shoot enemies without reloading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the energetic engineer Sara and blast away evil aliens in a thrilling, over-the-top firefight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.poster.avif?t=1752236363\" width=556 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.webm?t=1752236363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319460/extras/3f4a4a17a2be4306bbe3c02ab3ace7eb.mp4?t=1752236363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No reloads, no ammo pickups. Just shoot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about reloading - your ammo is infinite! Enjoy pure, uninterrupted action as you mow down hordes of enemies with non-stop gunfire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-wield for double the firepower.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sara can equip a different gun in each hand. Choose your favorite combos and unleash overwhelming firepower to dominate the battlefield in your own style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly generated levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: level layouts, enemy spawns, and item drops are all randomized. Sometimes you'll get lucky. Sometimes you'll be cornered. How you survive is up to your skills and decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get stronger, run after run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Sara falls, your progress resets - but the money you've earned can be used to unlock permanent upgrades. With every run, you'll get a little stronger. Take on the challenge, experiment, and enjoy the sweet feeling of progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you beat Hell Mode?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five difficulty levels. Start off with the light-hearted Comical Mode - even a baby could clear it (probably). But the ultimate challenge awaits in Hell Mode, where only the toughest players survive. Are you ready to push your limits?</p></li></ul>",
